---
title: Validation Flow (sequence) - OmniSign signature validation
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as Desktop / CLI
  participant UC as ValidateDocumentUseCase
  participant Repo as DssValidationRepository
  participant DSS as DSS SignedDocumentValidator
  participant Trust as EU LOTL + trusted lists
  participant Rev as OCSP / CRL responders
  participant Rep as ValidationReport

  User->>App: validate(signedDocument, parameters)
  App->>UC: invoke(ValidationParameters)
  UC->>Repo: validateDocument(params)
  Repo->>Trust: resolve trust anchors + build certificate verifier
  Trust-->>Repo: certificate verifier (LOTL + custom TLs + app store)
  Repo->>DSS: create validator + set certificate verifier
  Repo->>DSS: validateDocument (optional ETSI policy)
  Note over DSS: extract signatures, build certificate chains
  opt checkRevocation enabled
    DSS->>Rev: fetch OCSP / CRL
    Rev-->>DSS: revocation status
  end
  DSS->>DSS: validate timestamps (POE), compute eIDAS qualification
  DSS-->>Repo: Reports (Simple, Detailed, Diagnostic)
  Repo->>Repo: convert reports to domain model
  Note over Repo: per signature: indication + qualification mapped to SignatureTrustTier (QUALIFIED_QSCD / QUALIFIED / NOT_QUALIFIED)
  Note over Repo: per timestamp: TimestampValidationResult
  Repo->>Repo: collect + sanitize warnings
  Repo->>Rep: build ValidationReport (overall + signatures + timestamps + warnings)
  Repo-->>UC: OperationResult (ValidationReport)
  UC-->>App: report
  App-->>User: validation report
